@Chris Misztur 

The purpose of I3X is to be object oriented with object types, and at this level of the Manufacturing Stack, the expectation is that the Information model will be higher level than PLC tags /UDTs. 

Information Contextualization represents mapping data into these higher level information models. Let me know if there is a better label for that.

